      "title": "想老伴",
      "silenceAfterMs": null,
      "scores": null,
      "replies": [
        {
          "turn": 0,
          "kind": "greeting",
          "text": "早上好呀，霜降时节凉意渐浓，您今早喝杯热茶了吗？",
          "chars": 21,
          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "哎呀，今天是个特别的日子。您心里肯定不好受吧？",
          "chars": 20,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": 945,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "五年了，时间过得真快。您心里还是这么惦记他呀？",
          "chars": 20,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": 676,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "这种思念是刻在骨子里的，五年也没冲淡。他肯定知道您一直记挂着，心里也是暖的。",
          "chars": 34,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 886,
          "mentioned": false
        }
      ]
    },
